This package bundles two classifier files from ProzorroUKR/standards
(https://github.com/ProzorroUKR/standards), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
  src/prozorro_mcp/data/dk021_uk.json  (ДК 021:2015 / CPV, Ukrainian names)
  src/prozorro_mcp/data/ua_regions.json (regions of Ukraine)

Tender and plan data come from the public Prozorro API
(https://public-api.prozorro.gov.ua). The bundled demo snapshot is a small
extract of that public data with contact persons removed.
